@startuml "VNPay Payment Sequence"
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam defaultFontName "Times New Roman"
actor "Sinh viên" as Student
participant "Giao diện" as FE
participant "VNPayController" as VC
participant "VNPayService" as VS
participant "InvoiceDAO" as IDAO
participant "VNPay" as VNPay

database "CSDL" as DB

Student -> FE: Chọn hóa đơn + Thanh toán
FE -> VC: POST /api/vnpay/create-payment
VC -> VS: createPaymentUrl(amount, txnRef)
VS --> VC: paymentUrl
VC --> FE: paymentUrl
FE -> VNPay: Redirect paymentUrl
VNPay --> VC: GET /api/vnpay/ipn
VC -> VS: verifySignature(params)
VC -> IDAO: markAsPaid(invoiceId)
IDAO -> DB: UPDATE invoices
DB --> IDAO: OK
VC --> VNPay: RspCode=00
VNPay --> FE: Redirect /payment/result
@enduml
